(3026368, 426414, 7743, '<td valign="top">I''m sure this is a very nice scene when the sun is shining.  You''ve done well to bring out some of the colour on this dull day.  However, I think more vibrant colours are needed to give the image more WOW.</td>', 'I''m sure this is a very nice scene when the sun is shining.  You''ve done well to bring out some of the colour on this dull day.  However, I think more vibrant colours are needed to give the image more WOW.', '2006-11-13 10:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
