(3026440, 426768, 62095, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  The line between the skyline and the trees is pretty harsh, though I expect that it would be a tricky line to blend, maybe some low-opacity erasing if this is two or more layers?</td>', 'Interesting shot.  The line between the skyline and the trees is pretty harsh, though I expect that it would be a tricky line to blend, maybe some low-opacity erasing if this is two or more layers?', '2006-11-13 11:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
