(3026457, 426729, 24454, '<td valign="top">Well, I don''t know a whole lot about what makes a great HDR photo -- but I do think this is very cool!   And it shows a great range of light, shadows and color, so I think it''s very good!  I like the subject matter too  It''s interesting!  Something about it reminds me of a cool greeting card!  Great job.</td>', 'Well, I don''t know a whole lot about what makes a great HDR photo -- but I do think this is very cool!   And it shows a great range of light, shadows and color, so I think it''s very good!  I like the subject matter too  It''s interesting!  Something about it reminds me of a cool greeting card!  Great job.', '2006-11-13 11:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3026465, 426700, 7743, '<td valign="top">Though you''ve brought out detail in the bull''s face, I feel that the colours appear a little unnatural, especially the yellows.  FWIW, yellows and reds are the hardest colours to get right as they block up so easily.</td>', 'Though you''ve brought out detail in the bull''s face, I feel that the colours appear a little unnatural, especially the yellows.  FWIW, yellows and reds are the hardest colours to get right as they block up so easily.', '2006-11-13 11:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3026467, 426491, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohmy!  This would be a stunning photo on any account -- but the crisp tiny flock of birds really points out what an excellent HDR photo this is displaying such detail in the dark areas vs. the beautiful range of lights and color.   This is flawless!  10</td>', 'Ohmy!  This would be a stunning photo on any account -- but the crisp tiny flock of birds really points out what an excellent HDR photo this is displaying such detail in the dark areas vs. the beautiful range of lights and color.   This is flawless!  10', '2006-11-13 11:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
