(3026476, 426669, 24454, '<td valign="top">How pretty!!!!   As little as I know about HDR, this is an obvious display of the range of light, color, and shadows. And the 3-dimensional focus is nothing short of stunning!   Beuatiful photography!</td>', 'How pretty!!!!   As little as I know about HDR, this is an obvious display of the range of light, color, and shadows. And the 3-dimensional focus is nothing short of stunning!   Beuatiful photography!', '2006-11-13 11:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
