(3026842, 426717, 45524, '<td valign="top">I voted this photo an 8. I love the clarity, the detail and the effects of the long exposure on it. The composition is pretty good. Its tough to find fault in it. However I think there are a few spots that might have been toned down a bit with regards to the highlights. Namely the sign on the freeway. Overall excellent entry and I think will score well overall in the challenge.</td>', 'I voted this photo an 8. I love the clarity, the detail and the effects of the long exposure on it. The composition is pretty good. Its tough to find fault in it. However I think there are a few spots that might have been toned down a bit with regards to the highlights. Namely the sign on the freeway. Overall excellent entry and I think will score well overall in the challenge.', '2006-11-13 13:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3026843, 426813, 39973, '<td valign="top">Considering the use of HDR I would really like to see more detail in the dark areas.</td>', 'Considering the use of HDR I would really like to see more detail in the dark areas.', '2006-11-13 13:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3026847, 426802, 39973, '<td valign="top">I would love the shot if it wasn''t for the double exposure.</td>', 'I would love the shot if it wasn''t for the double exposure.', '2006-11-13 13:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3026850, 426346, 39973, '<td valign="top">Considering the use of HDR I would really like to see more detail in the trees.</td>', 'Considering the use of HDR I would really like to see more detail in the trees.', '2006-11-13 13:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3026851, 426617, 39973, '<td valign="top">Considering the use of HDR I would really like to see more detail in the foreground.</td>', 'Considering the use of HDR I would really like to see more detail in the foreground.', '2006-11-13 13:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3026856, 426503, 45524, '<td valign="top">This got an 8 from me. I love the coloring and the feel of it. It may go just a touch too much on the PP and the perspective seems a touch off. I would liked to have seen a little wider shot of this and maybe just a touch of correction in the perspective. Overall I predict a top 20 maybe top 10.</td>', 'This got an 8 from me. I love the coloring and the feel of it. It may go just a touch too much on the PP and the perspective seems a touch off. I would liked to have seen a little wider shot of this and maybe just a touch of correction in the perspective. Overall I predict a top 20 maybe top 10.', '2006-11-13 13:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3026858, 426315, 39973, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot. An interesting sky and/or removing the lense spots above the boat would really set it off.</td>', 'Gorgeous shot. An interesting sky and/or removing the lense spots above the boat would really set it off.', '2006-11-13 13:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3026874, 426824, 45524, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful shot with great coloring and detail. I scored this shot a 7. I dont have alot of complaints with the photo, but one thing I can say is the photo while beautiful doesnt seem to say anything to me other then its beautiful. WHat I''m trying to say in a poor way is that I dont see the main focal point of the photo. My eye goes left to right in the cityscape trying to find a main component to keep my attention and I just dont see it. Most of what I seem to draw on is the bridge however compared to the rest of the photo. Overall pretty well done.</td>', 'This is a wonderful shot with great coloring and detail. I scored this shot a 7. I dont have alot of complaints with the photo, but one thing I can say is the photo while beautiful doesnt seem to say anything to me other then its beautiful. WHat I''m trying to say in a poor way is that I dont see the main focal point of the photo. My eye goes left to right in the cityscape trying to find a main component to keep my attention and I just dont see it. Most of what I seem to draw on is the bridge however compared to the rest of the photo. Overall pretty well done.', '2006-11-13 13:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3026878, 426272, 45524, '<td valign="top">This got a 7 from me. I like the HDR process, I wish you had bumped the colors up just a touch and maybe added a bit more contrast to it. I also feel like I''m going downhill. Maybe it really is but I feel I need to lean to the left to look at for any length of time, and that hurts my neck. Overall nicely done. Good luck.</td>', 'This got a 7 from me. I like the HDR process, I wish you had bumped the colors up just a touch and maybe added a bit more contrast to it. I also feel like I''m going downhill. Maybe it really is but I feel I need to lean to the left to look at for any length of time, and that hurts my neck. Overall nicely done. Good luck.', '2006-11-13 13:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3026888, 426376, 45524, '<td valign="top">I scored this a 7. I love the colors, the detail. HOwever wider shot to include more of the tree and the foreground would have scored this higher from me. I am left wondering what is up at the top of that tree. A little more detail in the shadows would be nice if possible. Overall well shot and meets the challenge well.</td>', 'I scored this a 7. I love the colors, the detail. HOwever wider shot to include more of the tree and the foreground would have scored this higher from me. I am left wondering what is up at the top of that tree. A little more detail in the shadows would be nice if possible. Overall well shot and meets the challenge well.', '2006-11-13 13:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3026897, 426768, 45524, '<td valign="top">I scored this a 7. THis is a well thought out photo with good composition and processing. The colors are very nice, I might have bumped the green up just a touch more to go with the saturated reds. One thing that bothers me and maybe couldnt have been avoided is the birds in the background. I wish they werent there to clutter up the sky. Thats a personal thing for me though. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I scored this a 7. THis is a well thought out photo with good composition and processing. The colors are very nice, I might have bumped the green up just a touch more to go with the saturated reds. One thing that bothers me and maybe couldnt have been avoided is the birds in the background. I wish they werent there to clutter up the sky. Thats a personal thing for me though. Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-13 13:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3026925, 426266, 10686, '<td valign="top">Nice use of leading lines, and seems technically well done.<br/> <br/>I have a couple of suggestions and you are free to take them as you wish.<br/> <br/>First, the horizon seems a bit tilted to the right. It may just be an optical trick due to the shoreline on the right side, but it looks tiled a bit to me. <br/> <br/>Second, your viewpoint seems to be basically eye-level, which results in the centered horizon and the point of convergence for the leading lines dead center in the image. It makes for a very static composition. You might want to experiment with a noticably lower or, if possible, higher viewpoint.</td>', 'Nice use of leading lines, and seems technically well done. I have a couple of suggestions and you are free to take them as you wish. First, the horizon seems a bit tilted to the right. It may just be an optical trick due to the shoreline on the right side, but it looks tiled a bit to me.  Second, your viewpoint seems to be basically eye-level, which results in the centered horizon and the point of convergence for the leading lines dead center in the image. It makes for a very static composition. You might want to experiment with a noticably lower or, if possible, higher viewpoint.', '2006-11-13 13:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3026934, 426623, 10686, '<td valign="top">Maybe the blue is a bit too blue...</td>', 'Maybe the blue is a bit too blue...', '2006-11-13 13:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3026946, 426734, 10686, '<td valign="top">The blue sky is just a bit much</td>', 'The blue sky is just a bit much', '2006-11-13 13:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3026980, 426410, 67152, '<td valign="top">Use of Light:1<br/>Focus:1<br/>Composition:1<br/>Creativity:1<br/>Achieves Challenge:1<br/> <br/>The image is pretty and the colors are pretty vibrant (yellows).  The image itself really doesn''t stand out from the competition</td>', 'Use of Light:1Focus:1Composition:1Creativity:1Achieves Challenge:1 The image is pretty and the colors are pretty vibrant (yellows).  The image itself really doesn''t stand out from the competition', '2006-11-13 13:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3026986, 426539, 67152, '<td valign="top">Use of Light:1<br/>Focus:1<br/>Composition:1<br/>Creativity:1<br/>Achieves Challenge:1<br/> <br/>The flower colors and white snow really set of nicely against the dark background, but the sky is so dark and there is just so much of it (almost 1/2 the picture) that it distracts</td>', 'Use of Light:1Focus:1Composition:1Creativity:1Achieves Challenge:1 The flower colors and white snow really set of nicely against the dark background, but the sky is so dark and there is just so much of it (almost 1/2 the picture) that it distracts', '2006-11-13 13:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3026989, 426717, 67152, '<td valign="top">Use of Light:2<br/>Focus:2<br/>Composition:1<br/>Creativity:2<br/>Achieves Challenge:1<br/> <br/>Very nice use of HDR to get the clouds to pop out.  Nice work.</td>', 'Use of Light:2Focus:2Composition:1Creativity:2Achieves Challenge:1 Very nice use of HDR to get the clouds to pop out.  Nice work.', '2006-11-13 13:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3026997, 426729, 67152, '<td valign="top">Use of Light:1<br/>Focus:1<br/>Composition:1<br/>Creativity:1<br/>Achieves Challenge:0<br/>Color: -1<br/> <br/>The color of the sand (and the fact that there is so much of it - very yellow) takes away from the very neat image of the swimmers.</td>', 'Use of Light:1Focus:1Composition:1Creativity:1Achieves Challenge:0Color: -1 The color of the sand (and the fact that there is so much of it - very yellow) takes away from the very neat image of the swimmers.', '2006-11-13 13:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3027001, 426755, 67152, '<td valign="top">Use of Light:2<br/>Focus:1<br/>Composition:1<br/>Creativity:1<br/>Achieves Challenge:1<br/> <br/>Nice use of HDR to bring out the foreground and allow the sky to stay at the correct exposure.  However, the green in the grass is too vibrant for my liking.</td>', 'Use of Light:2Focus:1Composition:1Creativity:1Achieves Challenge:1 Nice use of HDR to bring out the foreground and allow the sky to stay at the correct exposure.  However, the green in the grass is too vibrant for my liking.', '2006-11-13 13:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3027003, 426800, 55837, '<td valign="top">Cool mobius megatar!  I have 2 of these and a chapman stick and I love''em. A guy I work with has 2 chapman sticks (a grand and an alto) and we are always cutting heads.</td>', 'Cool mobius megatar!  I have 2 of these and a chapman stick and I love''em. A guy I work with has 2 chapman sticks (a grand and an alto) and we are always cutting heads.', '2006-11-13 13:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3027005, 426700, 67152, '<td valign="top">Use of Light:1<br/>Focus:1<br/>Composition:1<br/>Creativity:1<br/>Achieves Challenge:1<br/> <br/>Use of HDR to show the detail of the animal was a nice approach.  The colors appear a little too vibrant on my screen (very bright greens and yellows).</td>', 'Use of Light:1Focus:1Composition:1Creativity:1Achieves Challenge:1 Use of HDR to show the detail of the animal was a nice approach.  The colors appear a little too vibrant on my screen (very bright greens and yellows).', '2006-11-13 13:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3027007, 426573, 67152, '<td valign="top">Use of Light:2<br/>Focus:1<br/>Composition:1<br/>Creativity:1<br/>Achieves Challenge:2<br/>Very understated use of HDR to bring out the darker sections of the tree lined road.  I would have preferred to see the road meander a little more off to the left.  Good job.</td>', 'Use of Light:2Focus:1Composition:1Creativity:1Achieves Challenge:2Very understated use of HDR to bring out the darker sections of the tree lined road.  I would have preferred to see the road meander a little more off to the left.  Good job.', '2006-11-13 14:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3027010, 426246, 67152, '<td valign="top">Use of Light:2<br/>Focus:1<br/>Composition:1<br/>Creativity:2<br/>Achieves Challenge:2<br/> <br/>Use of HDR to bring out the darker sections of the church was an excellent idea.</td>', 'Use of Light:2Focus:1Composition:1Creativity:2Achieves Challenge:2 Use of HDR to bring out the darker sections of the church was an excellent idea.', '2006-11-13 14:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3027011, 426485, 42100, '<td valign="top">Excellent, this puts a whole new flavour on the surf photo.  The composition very strong and dynamic.  The colors are very intense and beautiful.  In the sun area the colors do come borderline close to dividing attention too much from the surfer.  Definitely my top pick of this challenge, great job!</td>', 'Excellent, this puts a whole new flavour on the surf photo.  The composition very strong and dynamic.  The colors are very intense and beautiful.  In the sun area the colors do come borderline close to dividing attention too much from the surfer.  Definitely my top pick of this challenge, great job!', '2006-11-13 14:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3027016, 426789, 67152, '<td valign="top">Use of Light:1<br/>Focus:1<br/>Composition:1<br/>Creativity:1<br/>Achieves Challenge:1<br/> <br/>I like the angle of the shot, but the sides of the picture seem so cut off that it distrasts.  Nice colors and the brownish sky is interesting</td>', 'Use of Light:1Focus:1Composition:1Creativity:1Achieves Challenge:1 I like the angle of the shot, but the sides of the picture seem so cut off that it distrasts.  Nice colors and the brownish sky is interesting', '2006-11-13 14:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3027021, 426396, 67152, '<td valign="top">Use of Light:1<br/>Focus:2<br/>Composition:1<br/>Creativity:1<br/>Achieves Challenge:1<br/>Color -2<br/>I would have liked to see more of the second (green) tractor.  The colors that resulted from this HDR were far too vibrant.</td>', 'Use of Light:1Focus:2Composition:1Creativity:1Achieves Challenge:1Color -2I would have liked to see more of the second (green) tractor.  The colors that resulted from this HDR were far too vibrant.', '2006-11-13 14:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3027022, 426272, 42100, '<td valign="top">The HDR processing on this gives it a much more of surrealistic look.  It does seem to give a lot of depth and dimension to the photo, though.  I really do like this scene and composition, maybe the railing on the left side of the road could be eliminated or be used to more effectively balance the photo.  One of my top two pick, great job!</td>', 'The HDR processing on this gives it a much more of surrealistic look.  It does seem to give a lot of depth and dimension to the photo, though.  I really do like this scene and composition, maybe the railing on the left side of the road could be eliminated or be used to more effectively balance the photo.  One of my top two pick, great job!', '2006-11-13 14:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3027038, 426420, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very vivid color in this photo, almost too much, but not quite.  The composition is very interesting and seems to work very well with the rich color.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Very vivid color in this photo, almost too much, but not quite.  The composition is very interesting and seems to work very well with the rich color.  Nicely done!', '2006-11-13 14:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3027041, 426588, 67152, '<td valign="top">Use of Light:1<br/>Focus:1<br/>Composition:0<br/>Creativity:1<br/>Achieves Challenge:0<br/> <br/>There is too much brown water in the foreground for my taste.  The illuminated area in the top third (the fire I presume) does not set itself off enough.</td>', 'Use of Light:1Focus:1Composition:0Creativity:1Achieves Challenge:0 There is too much brown water in the foreground for my taste.  The illuminated area in the top third (the fire I presume) does not set itself off enough.', '2006-11-13 14:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3027048, 426768, 67152, '<td valign="top">Use of Light:1<br/>Focus:1<br/>Composition:1<br/>Creativity:1<br/>Achieves Challenge:1<br/> <br/>Nice attemplt on this.  The clouds seem too gray - too bad you didn''t have more than one day to find a better sky!  I think the color of the roof is a little too vibrant.</td>', 'Use of Light:1Focus:1Composition:1Creativity:1Achieves Challenge:1 Nice attemplt on this.  The clouds seem too gray - too bad you didn''t have more than one day to find a better sky!  I think the color of the roof is a little too vibrant.', '2006-11-13 14:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3027052, 426532, 12578, '<td valign="top">perhaps cloning out the watermark from the trial software would help the viewer see the image better.</td>', 'perhaps cloning out the watermark from the trial software would help the viewer see the image better.', '2006-11-13 14:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3027055, 426623, 67152, '<td valign="top">Use of Light:2<br/>Focus:1<br/>Composition:1<br/>Creativity:1<br/>Achieves Challenge:2<br/> <br/>Nice use of HDR to bring out the clouds and allow the foreground to ''get some light''.  I would have actually wanted a little more foreground illumination if possible.</td>', 'Use of Light:2Focus:1Composition:1Creativity:1Achieves Challenge:2 Nice use of HDR to bring out the clouds and allow the foreground to ''get some light''.  I would have actually wanted a little more foreground illumination if possible.', '2006-11-13 14:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3027059, 426399, 67152, '<td valign="top">Use of Light:0<br/>Focus:1<br/>Composition:1<br/>Creativity:1<br/>Achieves Challenge:0<br/> <br/>I don''t see the HDR - the foreground is very dark and the illuminated ceiling is also dark.</td>', 'Use of Light:0Focus:1Composition:1Creativity:1Achieves Challenge:0 I don''t see the HDR - the foreground is very dark and the illuminated ceiling is also dark.', '2006-11-13 14:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3027060, 426498, 42100, '<td valign="top">I can definitely see where the HDR processing worked on this photo.  You make a convincing argument for this type of processing as you used it very well to render a great photo with very natural look.  Nicely composed photo as well, great job!</td>', 'I can definitely see where the HDR processing worked on this photo.  You make a convincing argument for this type of processing as you used it very well to render a great photo with very natural look.  Nicely composed photo as well, great job!', '2006-11-13 14:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3027066, 426463, 67152, '<td valign="top">Use of Light:1<br/>Focus:1<br/>Composition:2<br/>Creativity:1<br/>Achieves Challenge:2<br/> <br/>Nice set up with the overhanging branch.  Also, good use of HDR to bring out the trees lining the other side of the pond.</td>', 'Use of Light:1Focus:1Composition:2Creativity:1Achieves Challenge:2 Nice set up with the overhanging branch.  Also, good use of HDR to bring out the trees lining the other side of the pond.', '2006-11-13 14:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3027073, 426745, 67152, '<td valign="top">Use of Light:1<br/>Focus:1<br/>Composition:1<br/>Creativity:1<br/>Achieves Challenge:1<br/> <br/>Nice effort on this one.  The rock formation appears washed out a bit, but the HDR does allow you to see the pretty partly sunny sky.</td>', 'Use of Light:1Focus:1Composition:1Creativity:1Achieves Challenge:1 Nice effort on this one.  The rock formation appears washed out a bit, but the HDR does allow you to see the pretty partly sunny sky.', '2006-11-13 14:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
