(3027198, 426340, 67152, '<td valign="top">Use of Light:1<br/>Focus:1<br/>Composition:1<br/>Creativity:1<br/>Achieves Challenge:2<br/> <br/>Nice effort with this photo.  The balance of the lighting is nicely done. I am not a big fan of the location of the bench - a little more the the middle.  And it is very hard to see the other bench in the background - you really have to look!</td>', 'Use of Light:1Focus:1Composition:1Creativity:1Achieves Challenge:2 Nice effort with this photo.  The balance of the lighting is nicely done. I am not a big fan of the location of the bench - a little more the the middle.  And it is very hard to see the other bench in the background - you really have to look!', '2006-11-13 14:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3027206, 426813, 67152, '<td valign="top">Use of Light:1<br/>Focus:0<br/>Composition:1<br/>Creativity:1<br/>Achieves Challenge:1<br/> <br/>Interesting red tint to this photo.  I think the soft focus of the buildings etc distracts me in this photo.  I would also have liked to see more illumination on the dark sections of the bank of the river</td>', 'Use of Light:1Focus:0Composition:1Creativity:1Achieves Challenge:1 Interesting red tint to this photo.  I think the soft focus of the buildings etc distracts me in this photo.  I would also have liked to see more illumination on the dark sections of the bank of the river', '2006-11-13 14:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3027214, 426521, 67152, '<td valign="top">Use of Light:0.5<br/>Focus:1<br/>Composition:1<br/>Creativity:0.5<br/>Achieves Challenge:1<br/> <br/>Good effort on using HDR to bring out the trees in the background without blowing out the brighter portions.  However, the image really isn''t all that pretty and is a little dark</td>', 'Use of Light:0.5Focus:1Composition:1Creativity:0.5Achieves Challenge:1 Good effort on using HDR to bring out the trees in the background without blowing out the brighter portions.  However, the image really isn''t all that pretty and is a little dark', '2006-11-13 14:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3027222, 426376, 67152, '<td valign="top">Use of Light:1<br/>Focus:2<br/>Composition:2<br/>Creativity:1<br/>Achieves Challenge:2<br/> <br/>Nice effort on this HDR challenge.  I love the oak leaves in the foreground.  I can see the whole image - darker areas are well illuminated and the sky (although not a beautiful one!) shows off well without being blown out.</td>', 'Use of Light:1Focus:2Composition:2Creativity:1Achieves Challenge:2 Nice effort on this HDR challenge.  I love the oak leaves in the foreground.  I can see the whole image - darker areas are well illuminated and the sky (although not a beautiful one!) shows off well without being blown out.', '2006-11-13 14:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3027231, 426501, 67152, '<td valign="top">Use of Light:1<br/>Focus:0.5<br/>Composition:0.5<br/>Creativity:1<br/>Achieves Challenge:2<br/> <br/>Nice effort to bring out the tree and not blow out the church or the sunny areas.  The "focus" seems a little too soft on the ferns (a little wind?)</td>', 'Use of Light:1Focus:0.5Composition:0.5Creativity:1Achieves Challenge:2 Nice effort to bring out the tree and not blow out the church or the sunny areas.  The "focus" seems a little too soft on the ferns (a little wind?)', '2006-11-13 14:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
