(3027241, 426753, 67152, '<td valign="top">Use of Light:1<br/>Focus:1<br/>Composition:1<br/>Creativity:1<br/>Achieves Challenge:2<br/> <br/>Challenging photo opportunity saved by HDR.  Good job using HDR to give good contrast in the foreground and not allowing the sky to get blown out.</td>', 'Use of Light:1Focus:1Composition:1Creativity:1Achieves Challenge:2 Challenging photo opportunity saved by HDR.  Good job using HDR to give good contrast in the foreground and not allowing the sky to get blown out.', '2006-11-13 14:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3027253, 426824, 67152, '<td valign="top">Use of Light:2<br/>Focus:1<br/>Composition:1<br/>Creativity:1<br/>Achieves Challenge:2<br/> <br/>I like this photo.  Your use of HDR brings out the subtle clouds in the sky well.  Good lighting and nice effort to keep the colors in check.</td>', 'Use of Light:2Focus:1Composition:1Creativity:1Achieves Challenge:2 I like this photo.  Your use of HDR brings out the subtle clouds in the sky well.  Good lighting and nice effort to keep the colors in check.', '2006-11-13 14:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3027257, 426272, 67152, '<td valign="top">Use of Light:1<br/>Focus:1<br/>Composition:1<br/>Creativity:1<br/>Achieves Challenge:2<br/> <br/>Nice use of HDR to bring out the interesting clouds while allowing proper illumination on the really interesting buildings in the foreground.  I would have dropped the saturation on the colors a little - the greens are a little too vibrant for my taste.</td>', 'Use of Light:1Focus:1Composition:1Creativity:1Achieves Challenge:2 Nice use of HDR to bring out the interesting clouds while allowing proper illumination on the really interesting buildings in the foreground.  I would have dropped the saturation on the colors a little - the greens are a little too vibrant for my taste.', '2006-11-13 14:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
