(3027517, 426315, 45475, '<td valign="top">Voted on this last night and came back to comment now. I think I love this more for the subject matter, perspective and muted colour, than the somewhat overly applied HDR which imo, renders it digital art in this instance. Having said that though, I gave it a 10 and now even with a second look over, cannot find justification for changing my vote. So I won''t - a 10 it remains :)</td>', 'Voted on this last night and came back to comment now. I think I love this more for the subject matter, perspective and muted colour, than the somewhat overly applied HDR which imo, renders it digital art in this instance. Having said that though, I gave it a 10 and now even with a second look over, cannot find justification for changing my vote. So I won''t - a 10 it remains :)', '2006-11-13 16:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3027518, 426785, 45475, '<td valign="top">This is such a wonderful, breathtaking scene and a great example of the best use for HDR. Congrats for being at the right place at the right time to capture it.</td>', 'This is such a wonderful, breathtaking scene and a great example of the best use for HDR. Congrats for being at the right place at the right time to capture it.', '2006-11-13 16:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3027555, 426753, 45524, '<td valign="top">I voted this photo a 6. I thought the highlights and shadows were brought together nicely. I wasnt too fond of the noisey appearanc ethat it seems to have. I''m not sure whats causing it weather it was ISO or something that happened in PP or resizing. I can see it mainly in the sky. Overall nicely done for meeting the challenge. Well done.</td>', 'I voted this photo a 6. I thought the highlights and shadows were brought together nicely. I wasnt too fond of the noisey appearanc ethat it seems to have. I''m not sure whats causing it weather it was ISO or something that happened in PP or resizing. I can see it mainly in the sky. Overall nicely done for meeting the challenge. Well done.', '2006-11-13 16:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3027557, 426789, 45524, '<td valign="top">This got a 6 from me. I thought you did a nice job meeting the challenge of HDR. I can detail in shadows and highlights. I''m not fond of the perspective or the tall crop. But thats likely just a personal thing with me. The coloring of the sky is nice. Good luck.</td>', 'This got a 6 from me. I thought you did a nice job meeting the challenge of HDR. I can detail in shadows and highlights. I''m not fond of the perspective or the tall crop. But thats likely just a personal thing with me. The coloring of the sky is nice. Good luck.', '2006-11-13 16:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3027560, 426558, 45524, '<td valign="top">6 from me. You seem to have met the challenge well. I''m not fond of the composition. It leaves me wondering what the rest of the building looks like. Overall the colors are nice, however the coloring in the steeples and roof blue, look very unnatural and grainy. Good luck. Fairly good balance between shadows and highlights.</td>', '6 from me. You seem to have met the challenge well. I''m not fond of the composition. It leaves me wondering what the rest of the building looks like. Overall the colors are nice, however the coloring in the steeples and roof blue, look very unnatural and grainy. Good luck. Fairly good balance between shadows and highlights.', '2006-11-13 16:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
