(3028894, 426142, 17279, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit washed out to me.</td>', 'Looks a bit washed out to me.', '2006-11-13 23:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028895, 426700, 53316, '<td valign="top">Saturation is a bit too bright for my tastes, and I am loosing a tiny bit of detail in the face, however this has great composition and contrast, and is a very great capture of an intreguing subject.</td>', 'Saturation is a bit too bright for my tastes, and I am loosing a tiny bit of detail in the face, however this has great composition and contrast, and is a very great capture of an intreguing subject.', '2006-11-13 23:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028899, 426546, 53316, '<td valign="top">This type of processing is often hit-or-miss with me - I find that sometimes it can detract from certain types of subjects and often is not done well. But here, you chose a perfect subject for the processing.  <br/> <br/>I really admire this shot. In addition to the processing, I love the colors and the detail in the feflection and dust on the truck.</td>', 'This type of processing is often hit-or-miss with me - I find that sometimes it can detract from certain types of subjects and often is not done well. But here, you chose a perfect subject for the processing.   I really admire this shot. In addition to the processing, I love the colors and the detail in the feflection and dust on the truck.', '2006-11-13 23:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028905, 426498, 61818, '<td valign="top">Another rare and excellent example of HDR imaging.  Nothing silhouetted and very nice lighting all around.  I hope this does well, though I''m afraid one of the many hallucinogenic nightmares I just clicked past in horror will probably take the prize.</td>', 'Another rare and excellent example of HDR imaging.  Nothing silhouetted and very nice lighting all around.  I hope this does well, though I''m afraid one of the many hallucinogenic nightmares I just clicked past in horror will probably take the prize.', '2006-11-14 00:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028906, 426669, 61818, '<td valign="top">I was wondering if anyone would do something like this what with all the talk of mundane landscape shots.  This is a really great example of what HDR can be used for in a non-LSD inspired fashion.  The details through the window aren''t overexposed, the still life is not a shadowed mess.  Nice job and good luck.</td>', 'I was wondering if anyone would do something like this what with all the talk of mundane landscape shots.  This is a really great example of what HDR can be used for in a non-LSD inspired fashion.  The details through the window aren''t overexposed, the still life is not a shadowed mess.  Nice job and good luck.', '2006-11-14 00:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028916, 426142, 53316, '<td valign="top">Interesting commposition, and I really like the reflections in the windows.</td>', 'Interesting commposition, and I really like the reflections in the windows.', '2006-11-14 00:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028918, 426549, 53316, '<td valign="top">WOW! This looks like glass. Simply amazing.</td>', 'WOW! This looks like glass. Simply amazing.', '2006-11-14 00:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028923, 426802, 53316, '<td valign="top">Great colors and concept. At first I thought your shot was too grainy but after a second look I think it''s just the colors in the rock (which.. wow, those rocks are really awesome) since your sky and water look so great.</td>', 'Great colors and concept. At first I thought your shot was too grainy but after a second look I think it''s just the colors in the rock (which.. wow, those rocks are really awesome) since your sky and water look so great.', '2006-11-14 00:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028925, 426539, 53316, '<td valign="top">Awesome! I love the black sky and bright flowers. A really great combination.</td>', 'Awesome! I love the black sky and bright flowers. A really great combination.', '2006-11-14 00:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028927, 426501, 53316, '<td valign="top">Wow, I love the composition. Great choice of subject as well!</td>', 'Wow, I love the composition. Great choice of subject as well!', '2006-11-14 00:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028933, 426125, 53316, '<td valign="top">I love the yellow and blue color combination.</td>', 'I love the yellow and blue color combination.', '2006-11-14 00:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028942, 426820, 53316, '<td valign="top">Hm. This shot looks kind of drab... and I think that''s the point, but it just doesn''t appeal to me as much. I don''t know how else you would have done it, though, so I think you probably did well.  I do like the detail in the clouds and smoke.</td>', 'Hm. This shot looks kind of drab... and I think that''s the point, but it just doesn''t appeal to me as much. I don''t know how else you would have done it, though, so I think you probably did well.  I do like the detail in the clouds and smoke.', '2006-11-14 00:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028948, 426155, 53316, '<td valign="top">Ooof. I think that your horizon is probably straight, but the lines of the bridges fool my eyes into thinking that the shot''s leaning over. Other than that, I think this shot is great. I like the detail that is visible in the buildings.</td>', 'Ooof. I think that your horizon is probably straight, but the lines of the bridges fool my eyes into thinking that the shot''s leaning over. Other than that, I think this shot is great. I like the detail that is visible in the buildings.', '2006-11-14 00:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028950, 426742, 53316, '<td valign="top">Colors just seem very off to me. But when I look at it as a painting, or whatever, and not "view I would see out my window" I love it!</td>', 'Colors just seem very off to me. But when I look at it as a painting, or whatever, and not "view I would see out my window" I love it!', '2006-11-14 00:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028955, 426785, 53316, '<td valign="top">The image seems a bit muddy overall. Maybe that is what you were going for, though.  In every other way this shot makes me go "ooooh wow". The hills blend into the clouds so wonderfully, and the rays of light just seem devine.</td>', 'The image seems a bit muddy overall. Maybe that is what you were going for, though.  In every other way this shot makes me go "ooooh wow". The hills blend into the clouds so wonderfully, and the rays of light just seem devine.', '2006-11-14 00:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028957, 426498, 53316, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and composition... and I hope that she didn''t get too cold!</td>', 'Beautiful colors and composition... and I hope that she didn''t get too cold!', '2006-11-14 00:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028960, 426392, 53316, '<td valign="top">Okay, I love the grain! I know others might hate it (and if it''s not what you were going for the higher kb size would have helped) but I think it works very well for this shot. It kind of goes with the depth of focus and makes this feel very "artsy"  (for lack of a better word).  I might have prefered a bit of a tighter crop on the right side.</td>', 'Okay, I love the grain! I know others might hate it (and if it''s not what you were going for the higher kb size would have helped) but I think it works very well for this shot. It kind of goes with the depth of focus and makes this feel very "artsy"  (for lack of a better word).  I might have prefered a bit of a tighter crop on the right side.', '2006-11-14 00:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028964, 426691, 53316, '<td valign="top">What a gorgeous abstract!! Just beautiful. I love the colors and the crop.</td>', 'What a gorgeous abstract!! Just beautiful. I love the colors and the crop.', '2006-11-14 00:20:14.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3029025, 426745, 17279, '<td valign="top">Interesting scenic with a nice curve on the overhang.  The image lacks a central point of interest though IMO. 7</td>', 'Interesting scenic with a nice curve on the overhang.  The image lacks a central point of interest though IMO. 7', '2006-11-14 00:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029027, 426569, 17279, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.  The leaves in the water really get lost though among the tree reflections.  Nice colors. 8</td>', 'Beautiful image.  The leaves in the water really get lost though among the tree reflections.  Nice colors. 8', '2006-11-14 00:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029028, 426226, 17279, '<td valign="top">Nice splash of color!</td>', 'Nice splash of color!', '2006-11-14 00:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029030, 426404, 64795, '<td valign="top">Lovely!  I hope this ribbons!</td>', 'Lovely!  I hope this ribbons!', '2006-11-14 01:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029033, 426303, 64795, '<td valign="top">Oh my gosh!  This is great!  The best one of them all!</td>', 'Oh my gosh!  This is great!  The best one of them all!', '2006-11-14 01:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029060, 426705, 62755, '<td valign="top">Good shot... but not really hdr... 5</td>', 'Good shot... but not really hdr... 5', '2006-11-14 01:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029061, 426546, 62755, '<td valign="top">Great style.. 8</td>', 'Great style.. 8', '2006-11-14 01:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029100, 426340, 25355, '<td valign="top">It''s only by luck that I understand the title, because I had this photo open while having a long chat and saw the other bench. It would be easy to miss if one did not have the luxury of such a long view of it. So ... perhaps your title is too obscure.<br/>  Anyway, I think your processing is spot on. ;-)</td>', 'It''s only by luck that I understand the title, because I had this photo open while having a long chat and saw the other bench. It would be easy to miss if one did not have the luxury of such a long view of it. So ... perhaps your title is too obscure.  Anyway, I think your processing is spot on. ;-)', '2006-11-14 02:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029102, 426485, 3214, '<td valign="top">gorgeous scene/composition, but the lower half''s processing looks plastic on my calibrated monitor.</td>', 'gorgeous scene/composition, but the lower half''s processing looks plastic on my calibrated monitor.', '2006-11-14 02:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029107, 426396, 17279, '<td valign="top">Great colors here!</td>', 'Great colors here!', '2006-11-14 02:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029111, 426212, 17279, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky and skyline.  The billboard is very distracting though.</td>', 'Beautiful sky and skyline.  The billboard is very distracting though.', '2006-11-14 02:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029114, 426650, 17279, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, you were kursed with a boring sky here.  Otherwise a nice image.</td>', 'Unfortunately, you were kursed with a boring sky here.  Otherwise a nice image.', '2006-11-14 02:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029115, 426365, 17279, '<td valign="top">The colors on the sky seem oversaturated to me... almost unreal, and the buildings seem a bit washed out.</td>', 'The colors on the sky seem oversaturated to me... almost unreal, and the buildings seem a bit washed out.', '2006-11-14 02:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029117, 426802, 17279, '<td valign="top">Great texture on the rocks.  I would have liked to see the person on the left as the focal point of the image and lose the ghost image.</td>', 'Great texture on the rocks.  I would have liked to see the person on the left as the focal point of the image and lose the ghost image.', '2006-11-14 02:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029119, 426549, 17279, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition.</td>', 'Beautiful composition.', '2006-11-14 02:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029120, 426766, 53316, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition that suits the subject well. Great colors also!</td>', 'Beautiful composition that suits the subject well. Great colors also!', '2006-11-14 02:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029121, 426399, 3214, '<td valign="top">good use of the technique</td>', 'good use of the technique', '2006-11-14 02:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029123, 426558, 17279, '<td valign="top">Great sky and lighting!</td>', 'Great sky and lighting!', '2006-11-14 02:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029124, 426533, 53316, '<td valign="top">The trees look like they''re leaning different ways - normally I find that visually unappealing but I think here, it enhances the sense of motion in the shot and makes me imagine I am in a car about to travel those turns.</td>', 'The trees look like they''re leaning different ways - normally I find that visually unappealing but I think here, it enhances the sense of motion in the shot and makes me imagine I am in a car about to travel those turns.', '2006-11-14 02:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029125, 426246, 3214, '<td valign="top">as a stylized image, this works well.</td>', 'as a stylized image, this works well.', '2006-11-14 02:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029127, 426303, 17279, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully textured sky.  I love the lines of the barren roadway which lead you straight to the sky.  Perhaps bringing out some of the foliage colors a bit more? 9</td>', 'Wonderfully textured sky.  I love the lines of the barren roadway which lead you straight to the sky.  Perhaps bringing out some of the foliage colors a bit more? 9', '2006-11-14 02:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029128, 426729, 53316, '<td valign="top">I like the composition a great deal, but do not care for the yellowish tint.</td>', 'I like the composition a great deal, but do not care for the yellowish tint.', '2006-11-14 02:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029129, 426420, 17279, '<td valign="top">Amazing color on this image.</td>', 'Amazing color on this image.', '2006-11-14 02:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029130, 426226, 3214, '<td valign="top">very saturated, but I like it.</td>', 'very saturated, but I like it.', '2006-11-14 02:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029132, 426781, 53316, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit oversharpened in places. But wonderful colors and very vibrant composition.</td>', 'Looks a bit oversharpened in places. But wonderful colors and very vibrant composition.', '2006-11-14 02:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029135, 426523, 53316, '<td valign="top">Wow, super-cool title!! I like the colors here.</td>', 'Wow, super-cool title!! I like the colors here.', '2006-11-14 02:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029139, 426617, 53316, '<td valign="top">I kind of get the sense of out of focus. But if I look at it while not trying to see more detail than is there, then this is a very lovely "abstract-ish" photo.  The colors are just great. I love how the mountains are blue where they hit the sky.</td>', 'I kind of get the sense of out of focus. But if I look at it while not trying to see more detail than is there, then this is a very lovely "abstract-ish" photo.  The colors are just great. I love how the mountains are blue where they hit the sky.', '2006-11-14 02:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029142, 426346, 53316, '<td valign="top">Ooohh...... just.. gorgeous. The white flowers and the blue tiny square in the top-right-ish are a bit distracting. Everything else... amazing. I especially love the reflection of the sunlight in the water (not puddle) as well as the deep colors of brown(red), green, and blue that your title mentions. Very awesome photo.</td>', 'Ooohh...... just.. gorgeous. The white flowers and the blue tiny square in the top-right-ish are a bit distracting. Everything else... amazing. I especially love the reflection of the sunlight in the water (not puddle) as well as the deep colors of brown(red), green, and blue that your title mentions. Very awesome photo.', '2006-11-14 02:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029143, 426520, 53316, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot! I love the concept. Might have prefered a tighter crop at the top.</td>', 'Interesting shot! I love the concept. Might have prefered a tighter crop at the top.', '2006-11-14 02:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029146, 426376, 53316, '<td valign="top">Bleak, yet you managed to capture both bleak and vibrant beauty. A photo that does this well, as yours does, is truly an amazing image.</td>', 'Bleak, yet you managed to capture both bleak and vibrant beauty. A photo that does this well, as yours does, is truly an amazing image.', '2006-11-14 02:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029204, 426396, 61478, '<td valign="top">great</td>', 'great', '2006-11-14 03:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029221, 426755, 39243, '<td valign="top">another photo that is making this my favorite challenge to view! Thanks. The only thing I would change is to make the pic fit the max size so we could view it better.</td>', 'another photo that is making this my favorite challenge to view! Thanks. The only thing I would change is to make the pic fit the max size so we could view it better.', '2006-11-14 03:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029224, 426503, 39243, '<td valign="top">another photo that is making this my favorite challenge to view! Thanks. I personally think you have a ribbon here - 10</td>', 'another photo that is making this my favorite challenge to view! Thanks. I personally think you have a ribbon here - 10', '2006-11-14 03:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029225, 426246, 39243, '<td valign="top">another photo that is making this my favorite challenge to view! Thanks. I personally think you have a ribbon here. this one and that other interior of a church are just amazing! 10</td>', 'another photo that is making this my favorite challenge to view! Thanks. I personally think you have a ribbon here. this one and that other interior of a church are just amazing! 10', '2006-11-14 03:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029226, 426491, 39243, '<td valign="top">another photo that is making this my favorite challenge to view! Thanks. I sure hope this ribbons - it is just beautiful. 10</td>', 'another photo that is making this my favorite challenge to view! Thanks. I sure hope this ribbons - it is just beautiful. 10', '2006-11-14 03:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029227, 426392, 39243, '<td valign="top">great photo - great composition - At first I almost dismissed this photo. I am real glad I did a double take. Completely different than anything else I have seen so far. 9.</td>', 'great photo - great composition - At first I almost dismissed this photo. I am real glad I did a double take. Completely different than anything else I have seen so far. 9.', '2006-11-14 03:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029261, 426586, 53316, '<td valign="top">I LOVE love love love the composition! The colors are wonderful as well.</td>', 'I LOVE love love love the composition! The colors are wonderful as well.', '2006-11-14 04:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029262, 426601, 53316, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit too dark maybe? But I love the concept, and really love the lines across the face - gives it a very neat feel.</td>', 'Seems a bit too dark maybe? But I love the concept, and really love the lines across the face - gives it a very neat feel.', '2006-11-14 04:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029264, 426144, 53316, '<td valign="top">Wow, I think... I think the red would totally overpower the girl except for those beautiful eyes. Very large and expressive and they hold their own against the attention-grabbing red.</td>', 'Wow, I think... I think the red would totally overpower the girl except for those beautiful eyes. Very large and expressive and they hold their own against the attention-grabbing red.', '2006-11-14 04:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029265, 426755, 53316, '<td valign="top">Oooh, lovely composition and colors... and those are my favorite type of clouds.</td>', 'Oooh, lovely composition and colors... and those are my favorite type of clouds.', '2006-11-14 04:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029268, 426226, 53316, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and textures here.  Also I don''t think the picture suffers due to the flowers being a bit dry. I think it gives it interest.. definitely makes me stop and look more than I would if the flowers were perfectly in bloom.</td>', 'I love the colors and textures here.  Also I don''t think the picture suffers due to the flowers being a bit dry. I think it gives it interest.. definitely makes me stop and look more than I would if the flowers were perfectly in bloom.', '2006-11-14 04:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029272, 426623, 53316, '<td valign="top">I personally hate the lines made by airplanes so if this were my shot I would have tried to clone that out. But that''s just my preference.  I like the photo overall, especially the whispy clouds and the reflection in the water.</td>', 'I personally hate the lines made by airplanes so if this were my shot I would have tried to clone that out. But that''s just my preference.  I like the photo overall, especially the whispy clouds and the reflection in the water.', '2006-11-14 04:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029274, 426503, 53316, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. I feel like I can see every single detail. Colors are great and composition is very balanced.</td>', 'Beautiful. I feel like I can see every single detail. Colors are great and composition is very balanced.', '2006-11-14 04:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029277, 426315, 53316, '<td valign="top">I can almost feel the metal, this looks so metalic. I think that your processing worked very well for your subject(s).</td>', 'I can almost feel the metal, this looks so metalic. I think that your processing worked very well for your subject(s).', '2006-11-14 04:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029278, 426768, 53316, '<td valign="top">Great title. Lovely colors and composition.</td>', 'Great title. Lovely colors and composition.', '2006-11-14 04:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029285, 426705, 53316, '<td valign="top">Wow! Awesome detail.</td>', 'Wow! Awesome detail.', '2006-11-14 04:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029286, 426804, 53316, '<td valign="top">A lovely abstract, but my eyes are finding it a bit hard to not have a spot to focus on. I like the lighting.</td>', 'A lovely abstract, but my eyes are finding it a bit hard to not have a spot to focus on. I like the lighting.', '2006-11-14 04:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029289, 426428, 53316, '<td valign="top">I would have prefered a tighter crop on the right side to improve the composition. Also the image looks a little fuzzy - maybe because of the smaller file size?  However I like the concept and I definitely love the clouds that you captured.</td>', 'I would have prefered a tighter crop on the right side to improve the composition. Also the image looks a little fuzzy - maybe because of the smaller file size?  However I like the concept and I definitely love the clouds that you captured.', '2006-11-14 04:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029291, 426708, 53316, '<td valign="top">The bottom of the image confuses me a little as to what it is, and I might have prefered seeing the top of the hill/mountain in the background. But I like the detail and color here.  You have made a simple subject look pretty cool.</td>', 'The bottom of the image confuses me a little as to what it is, and I might have prefered seeing the top of the hill/mountain in the background. But I like the detail and color here.  You have made a simple subject look pretty cool.', '2006-11-14 04:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029336, 426484, 53316, '<td valign="top">This photo is too busy for my tastes. But I think you did a good job photographing the beads (lighting/contrast especially).</td>', 'This photo is too busy for my tastes. But I think you did a good job photographing the beads (lighting/contrast especially).', '2006-11-14 05:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029355, 426520, 31307, '<td valign="top">I like the textures but the lighting seems rather flat.  More dynamic lighting would really have helped--especially with the stonework.</td>', 'I like the textures but the lighting seems rather flat.  More dynamic lighting would really have helped--especially with the stonework.', '2006-11-14 05:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029357, 426303, 31307, '<td valign="top">Love the title.  I like the tonality of the image as well.  I think I am going through an "urban" phase because these types of images are catching my eye more than normal.</td>', 'Love the title.  I like the tonality of the image as well.  I think I am going through an "urban" phase because these types of images are catching my eye more than normal.', '2006-11-14 05:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029362, 426813, 31307, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the red tinting on this.  It seems a little overdone and like there was a white balance mistake--something unintentional rather than purposeful.</td>', 'I don''t like the red tinting on this.  It seems a little overdone and like there was a white balance mistake--something unintentional rather than purposeful.', '2006-11-14 05:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029394, 426315, 41554, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot. Great use of HDR. The wide angle really helps too.</td>', 'Fantastic shot. Great use of HDR. The wide angle really helps too.', '2006-11-14 06:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029402, 426498, 31403, '<td valign="top">she stood there like that for 5 exposures?  With no blurring around the edges?  If this is really an HDR it is spectacularly difficult to do this!</td>', 'she stood there like that for 5 exposures?  With no blurring around the edges?  If this is really an HDR it is spectacularly difficult to do this!', '2006-11-14 06:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029403, 426745, 31403, '<td valign="top">lacks contrast</td>', 'lacks contrast', '2006-11-14 06:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029406, 426501, 31403, '<td valign="top">I''ll bet at full res the trunk''s texture is stunning - it''s not bad at low res either!  nice application of HDR</td>', 'I''ll bet at full res the trunk''s texture is stunning - it''s not bad at low res either!  nice application of HDR', '2006-11-14 06:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029407, 426346, 31403, '<td valign="top">slick photo and nice title - excellent overall presentation - 8 for now</td>', 'slick photo and nice title - excellent overall presentation - 8 for now', '2006-11-14 06:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029411, 426396, 31403, '<td valign="top">the neon green ruins this for me - love everything else about it, a little mask would have gone a long way! Clone that dude and his car out of there too please - :-)</td>', 'the neon green ruins this for me - love everything else about it, a little mask would have gone a long way! Clone that dude and his car out of there too please - :-)', '2006-11-14 06:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029415, 426212, 31403, '<td valign="top">why you would choose to pull attention away from your stunning photo by leaving advertising in it is something I can''t understand.  Upper 3/4s of this image is a 9, lower 1/4 is a 2.  7</td>', 'why you would choose to pull attention away from your stunning photo by leaving advertising in it is something I can''t understand.  Upper 3/4s of this image is a 9, lower 1/4 is a 2.  7', '2006-11-14 06:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029434, 426491, 67301, '<td valign="top">I adore this shot It has rich colour and great contrasts. It has a warm feeling to it and I just want to be there this is with out doubt the best shot in this challenge = 10</td>', 'I adore this shot It has rich colour and great contrasts. It has a warm feeling to it and I just want to be there this is with out doubt the best shot in this challenge = 10', '2006-11-14 06:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
