(3029456, 426742, 45524, '<td valign="top">This is a 6 from me. The image while generally pretty seems somewhat flat especially for an HDR. The shadows dont have the details brought out and the only thing with good coloring is the sky and it may be over done just a touch. I"d liked to have seen you bring the Dynamic range way out on this photo for this challenge. The shadows in the mountains could have really been brought out with alot of detail. Good luck.</td>', 'This is a 6 from me. The image while generally pretty seems somewhat flat especially for an HDR. The shadows dont have the details brought out and the only thing with good coloring is the sky and it may be over done just a touch. I"d liked to have seen you bring the Dynamic range way out on this photo for this challenge. The shadows in the mountains could have really been brought out with alot of detail. Good luck.', '2006-11-14 06:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
