(3030332, 426546, 27845, '<td valign="top">One of my two favs for the challenge. You achieved quite an impressive effect on the reflections, and the scenery somehow adds to the ''dirty'' car and ''dirty'' post processing. Good luck.</td>', 'One of my two favs for the challenge. You achieved quite an impressive effect on the reflections, and the scenery somehow adds to the ''dirty'' car and ''dirty'' post processing. Good luck.', '2006-11-14 12:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
