(3031601, 426691, 67152, '<td valign="top">Use of Light:2<br/>Focus:1<br/>Composition:1<br/>Creativity:2<br/>Achieves Challenge:2<br/> <br/>Great use of HDR to bring out the great clouds above - yet showing the dark area clearly along the horizon.  I just wish the horizon was slightly lower in the picture.</td>', 'Use of Light:2Focus:1Composition:1Creativity:2Achieves Challenge:2 Great use of HDR to bring out the great clouds above - yet showing the dark area clearly along the horizon.  I just wish the horizon was slightly lower in the picture.', '2006-11-14 20:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
