(3039554, 426246, 61368, '<td valign="top">The perspecitve works wonderfully. The vastness of the space is so emphasized and the range of tones make the beauty of the place shine.</td>', 'The perspecitve works wonderfully. The vastness of the space is so emphasized and the range of tones make the beauty of the place shine.', '2006-11-17 07:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039557, 426785, 61368, '<td valign="top">The details in the meandering hills are wonderful. The light coming through the clouds is so soft. I love the hazy lazy feel of this.</td>', 'The details in the meandering hills are wonderful. The light coming through the clouds is so soft. I love the hazy lazy feel of this.', '2006-11-17 07:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039558, 426491, 61368, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Image! The range really makes this pop. I think the crop is a little tight on the left. Love it anyway, bumped to a 9.</td>', 'Beautiful Image! The range really makes this pop. I think the crop is a little tight on the left. Love it anyway, bumped to a 9.', '2006-11-17 07:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039559, 426317, 61368, '<td valign="top">One of those scenes where HDR really makes it come alive. The position and angle you shot from makes me feel like I''m standing there. Nice shot.</td>', 'One of those scenes where HDR really makes it come alive. The position and angle you shot from makes me feel like I''m standing there. Nice shot.', '2006-11-17 07:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040089, 426317, 22748, '<td valign="top">I love the dramatic feel and the stark contrast between the dark sky &amp; surroundings with the bright green grass. The lines of the handrails lead the eye to the grass, as does the fact that it is more colorful and has light cast on it as if from heaven.<br/> <br/>The only thing suggestion I have is that the bright patch on the left side of the sky looks like it should be brighter. It appears blown out and void of detail, but it is slightly gray, so it looks a little fake when I look at it. Not a huge issue, but just the only thing I find wrong with the image. :)<br/> <br/>Really a fantastic image.</td>', 'I love the dramatic feel and the stark contrast between the dark sky & surroundings with the bright green grass. The lines of the handrails lead the eye to the grass, as does the fact that it is more colorful and has light cast on it as if from heaven. The only thing suggestion I have is that the bright patch on the left side of the sky looks like it should be brighter. It appears blown out and void of detail, but it is slightly gray, so it looks a little fake when I look at it. Not a huge issue, but just the only thing I find wrong with the image. :) Really a fantastic image.', '2006-11-17 11:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040097, 426303, 22748, '<td valign="top">Wow. The first thing I get from this image is the feeling that a storm has just passed over, it is now evening, and the sun is setting peacefully with a warm glow. The dramatic sky along with the gritty, contrasty feel of the pavement and landscape are seen next to the warm sunset sky off to the left. <br/> <br/>Great symmetry in this image. The way you lined up the street lights appears carefully done. Excellent HDR work as well, it has good overall contrast, detail, and color without having any bad halos.</td>', 'Wow. The first thing I get from this image is the feeling that a storm has just passed over, it is now evening, and the sun is setting peacefully with a warm glow. The dramatic sky along with the gritty, contrasty feel of the pavement and landscape are seen next to the warm sunset sky off to the left.  Great symmetry in this image. The way you lined up the street lights appears carefully done. Excellent HDR work as well, it has good overall contrast, detail, and color without having any bad halos.', '2006-11-17 12:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040102, 426539, 22748, '<td valign="top">I love the colorful and bright foreground vegetation with the scene fading to a dull gray foggy feel in the distance. The foreground feels like it is bathed in a little spot of sunlight breaking through the fog.</td>', 'I love the colorful and bright foreground vegetation with the scene fading to a dull gray foggy feel in the distance. The foreground feels like it is bathed in a little spot of sunlight breaking through the fog.', '2006-11-17 12:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040105, 426272, 22748, '<td valign="top">Good contrast and color. Good work on the HDR, there are no nasty halos to be seen. I like the sharpness and the detail in this image.</td>', 'Good contrast and color. Good work on the HDR, there are no nasty halos to be seen. I like the sharpness and the detail in this image.', '2006-11-17 12:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040108, 426734, 22748, '<td valign="top">Holy schneike! Beautiful colors! This looks like a painting. I''m serious, the colors are amazing. How did you do it? Gorgeous blue sky and fall colors. Great detail in the building, but excellent smoothness to the sky and water (no noise! yay!). <br/> <br/>This is a stellar piece of art.</td>', 'Holy schneike! Beautiful colors! This looks like a painting. I''m serious, the colors are amazing. How did you do it? Gorgeous blue sky and fall colors. Great detail in the building, but excellent smoothness to the sky and water (no noise! yay!).  This is a stellar piece of art.', '2006-11-17 12:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040380, 426346, 42100, '<td valign="top">Some really great colors in this, very rich and vibrant.  Good composition as well too make a rather ordinary scene quite interesting.  Minor complaint is the bright spots on the reflected water, my eyes seem to have a tough time getting around them when moving through this photo.  Great job!</td>', 'Some really great colors in this, very rich and vibrant.  Good composition as well too make a rather ordinary scene quite interesting.  Minor complaint is the bright spots on the reflected water, my eyes seem to have a tough time getting around them when moving through this photo.  Great job!', '2006-11-17 14:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040383, 426785, 42100, '<td valign="top">A very dark and moody scene, beautifully composed.  Very nice!</td>', 'A very dark and moody scene, beautifully composed.  Very nice!', '2006-11-17 14:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040395, 426520, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very interesting HDR results, looks very much like illustrations from childhood fairy tales.  The color of the jacket draws you to your subject instantly but doesn''t overpower.  Well done!</td>', 'Very interesting HDR results, looks very much like illustrations from childhood fairy tales.  The color of the jacket draws you to your subject instantly but doesn''t overpower.  Well done!', '2006-11-17 14:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040396, 426546, 42100, '<td valign="top">The HDR really give this a much more of a graphic art feel.  I do love how it really brings out a lot of the minor details of the photo and without making the photo to busy.  Very nice!</td>', 'The HDR really give this a much more of a graphic art feel.  I do love how it really brings out a lot of the minor details of the photo and without making the photo to busy.  Very nice!', '2006-11-17 14:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
