(3041179, 426802, 7969, '<td valign="top">I am no sure that your people ''add'' to your shot, I find them placed in a way that takes away from the scene and they compete for my attention being on opposite sides. I really do like the landscape part of your shot tho.</td>', 'I am no sure that your people ''add'' to your shot, I find them placed in a way that takes away from the scene and they compete for my attention being on opposite sides. I really do like the landscape part of your shot tho.', '2006-11-17 21:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041243, 426558, 43437, '<td valign="top">beautiful setting, lighting is very nice, i would crop a bit more on the right though.</td>', 'beautiful setting, lighting is very nice, i would crop a bit more on the right though.', '2006-11-17 22:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041446, 426742, 67735, '<td valign="top">I think its really clever the way you tilt the screen of the laptop and the sky changes colour.</td>', 'I think its really clever the way you tilt the screen of the laptop and the sky changes colour.', '2006-11-18 01:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041664, 426734, 29770, '<td valign="top">Wow, stunning colors and detail.  I really like this one.</td>', 'Wow, stunning colors and detail.  I really like this one.', '2006-11-18 08:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041667, 426491, 29770, '<td valign="top">The lighting of the windmill against the sky is awesome.  Very nice.</td>', 'The lighting of the windmill against the sky is awesome.  Very nice.', '2006-11-18 08:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041669, 426246, 29770, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  The color of the stained glass and the table cloth really balance the monochromatic archetecture.  Very nice.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  The color of the stained glass and the table cloth really balance the monochromatic archetecture.  Very nice.', '2006-11-18 08:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041670, 426503, 29770, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture of such a beautiful place.  I love the lighting on the ceiling.  Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice capture of such a beautiful place.  I love the lighting on the ceiling.  Very nice.', '2006-11-18 08:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041671, 426484, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice glittery shine, but the photo needs something more.  The beads hanging around a womans neck, with her hand holding them, or unbuttoned collar, or something like that would give you a better story, and give the viewer a subject focus.</td>', 'Nice glittery shine, but the photo needs something more.  The beads hanging around a womans neck, with her hand holding them, or unbuttoned collar, or something like that would give you a better story, and give the viewer a subject focus.', '2006-11-18 08:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041673, 426601, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the image seems simply too dark for my taste -- I''d like to see more detail, especially to show off HDR.</td>', 'Nice idea, but the image seems simply too dark for my taste -- I''d like to see more detail, especially to show off HDR.', '2006-11-18 08:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041674, 426558, 29770, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  The blue of the church roof against the grey sky really make is stand out.  Nice job capturing the sun rays.</td>', 'Great capture.  The blue of the church roof against the grey sky really make is stand out.  Nice job capturing the sun rays.', '2006-11-18 08:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041676, 426707, 29770, '<td valign="top">This image evokes feelings of being back home for me.  Very nice capture.</td>', 'This image evokes feelings of being back home for me.  Very nice capture.', '2006-11-18 08:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041677, 426486, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice HDR, but a more interesting central subject than a drain grating would help, even an open manhole with warnings of men at work.</td>', 'Nice HDR, but a more interesting central subject than a drain grating would help, even an open manhole with warnings of men at work.', '2006-11-18 08:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041681, 426521, 44490, '<td valign="top">Interesting lines of the road.  The image seems somewhat low-contrast, probably suffers from low-light.  More light during day would probably be better since the overcast or twilight sky hasn''t given you nice color.  Maybe your conditions were severe, as you photo doesn''t show much dynamic range, e.g., recovered by HDR.</td>', 'Interesting lines of the road.  The image seems somewhat low-contrast, probably suffers from low-light.  More light during day would probably be better since the overcast or twilight sky hasn''t given you nice color.  Maybe your conditions were severe, as you photo doesn''t show much dynamic range, e.g., recovered by HDR.', '2006-11-18 08:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041683, 426586, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and sharpness, but I suggest not using the tilt unless it strongly reinforces something in the image.</td>', 'Nice colors and sharpness, but I suggest not using the tilt unless it strongly reinforces something in the image.', '2006-11-18 08:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041686, 426790, 44490, '<td valign="top">Maybe you were trying to show the chaos, clutter, and smoggy grayness that can be found in LA, having lived there myself, but I think that most viewers would prefer to see a different story -- also, less in-your-face poles would be better, and this image doesn''t demonstrate HDR much.</td>', 'Maybe you were trying to show the chaos, clutter, and smoggy grayness that can be found in LA, having lived there myself, but I think that most viewers would prefer to see a different story -- also, less in-your-face poles would be better, and this image doesn''t demonstrate HDR much.', '2006-11-18 08:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041689, 426781, 44490, '<td valign="top">Great subject, with colors and shine.  But the fence is in-your-face distracting when I want to see the carousel - consider moving up or closer.  Also revisit your tone mappings, your choices seem overdone and too unnatural.</td>', 'Great subject, with colors and shine.  But the fence is in-your-face distracting when I want to see the carousel - consider moving up or closer.  Also revisit your tone mappings, your choices seem overdone and too unnatural.', '2006-11-18 09:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041692, 426399, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice ceiling, but with the people in view, it looks like a subject miss since I can''t make out the people -- crop for the ceiling would be better.  Also, the people in motion lead me to believe that you didn''t use multiple exposures for HDR.</td>', 'Nice ceiling, but with the people in view, it looks like a subject miss since I can''t make out the people -- crop for the ceiling would be better.  Also, the people in motion lead me to believe that you didn''t use multiple exposures for HDR.', '2006-11-18 09:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041696, 426700, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, cow, and composition.  But the cow looks to be in motion, which leads me to believe that you didn''t use multiple exposures for HDR, just color saturation and contrast.</td>', 'Nice colors, cow, and composition.  But the cow looks to be in motion, which leads me to believe that you didn''t use multiple exposures for HDR, just color saturation and contrast.', '2006-11-18 09:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041699, 426428, 44490, '<td valign="top">Looks like the start of an idea, but it''s not strong enough to stand alone.  Tighter crop without the distracting trees would be better, and consider adding a torn net, BB shoes hanging from the rim, something that tells a story.  Image doesn''t seem to show HDR.</td>', 'Looks like the start of an idea, but it''s not strong enough to stand alone.  Tighter crop without the distracting trees would be better, and consider adding a torn net, BB shoes hanging from the rim, something that tells a story.  Image doesn''t seem to show HDR.', '2006-11-18 09:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041709, 426729, 44490, '<td valign="top">Looks like a swim team.  People in motion leads me to think that you didn''t use multiple exposures for HDR.  Image seems to have a yellow hue/cast.  Tighter crop removing some of the foreground would be better.</td>', 'Looks like a swim team.  People in motion leads me to think that you didn''t use multiple exposures for HDR.  Image seems to have a yellow hue/cast.  Tighter crop removing some of the foreground would be better.', '2006-11-18 09:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041711, 426346, 44490, '<td valign="top">Pretty good use of HDR to punch up the scene.  But I''m certain that you could find a better perspective and main subject.  The lake/pond has to be better than the puddle as a central subject and foreground for the tree.</td>', 'Pretty good use of HDR to punch up the scene.  But I''m certain that you could find a better perspective and main subject.  The lake/pond has to be better than the puddle as a central subject and foreground for the tree.', '2006-11-18 09:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041714, 426365, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice subject and composition.  Image seems somewhat too bright and washed out, darker would probably be better and would improve the sunset/colors/grain.</td>', 'Nice subject and composition.  Image seems somewhat too bright and washed out, darker would probably be better and would improve the sunset/colors/grain.', '2006-11-18 09:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041721, 426804, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice grasses, subtle colors.  Image suffers from too much motion blur, I can guess that the wind didn''t cooperate for multiple exposures.  A subject focus would help, maybe just try shooting a few of the grasses rather than the field?</td>', 'Nice grasses, subtle colors.  Image suffers from too much motion blur, I can guess that the wind didn''t cooperate for multiple exposures.  A subject focus would help, maybe just try shooting a few of the grasses rather than the field?', '2006-11-18 09:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041733, 426410, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice location - branches from left are distracting, consider moving lower and closer if possible, maybe angling up so that the line of the bridge is in the lower third of the frame, more trees - just a suggestion.  Image doesn''t seem to show HDR much, revisit tone mapping.</td>', 'Nice location - branches from left are distracting, consider moving lower and closer if possible, maybe angling up so that the line of the bridge is in the lower third of the frame, more trees - just a suggestion.  Image doesn''t seem to show HDR much, revisit tone mapping.', '2006-11-18 09:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041737, 426789, 44490, '<td valign="top">Interesting building.  Composition is dead-center, consider other composition alternatives, including additional buildings in frame.  Also consider correcting for perspective with advanced editing.</td>', 'Interesting building.  Composition is dead-center, consider other composition alternatives, including additional buildings in frame.  Also consider correcting for perspective with advanced editing.', '2006-11-18 09:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041750, 426414, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, interesting landscape.  Overall image feels too dark and too gray, brighter would probably be better.</td>', 'Nice composition, interesting landscape.  Overall image feels too dark and too gray, brighter would probably be better.', '2006-11-18 10:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041757, 426546, 44490, '<td valign="top">Given the subject and setting, the posterized look probably is a good idea.  But I''d prefer the truck isolated against a nicer background like the sky, with a more natural tone mapping.</td>', 'Given the subject and setting, the posterized look probably is a good idea.  But I''d prefer the truck isolated against a nicer background like the sky, with a more natural tone mapping.', '2006-11-18 10:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041762, 426588, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, nice idea, I think, but I can''t quite figure it out.  Did you put a candle in the hole?  And are those apples in the water?  A bump for keeping me looking, but I''m still puzzled and will have to check back.</td>', 'Nice composition, nice idea, I think, but I can''t quite figure it out.  Did you put a candle in the hole?  And are those apples in the water?  A bump for keeping me looking, but I''m still puzzled and will have to check back.', '2006-11-18 10:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041763, 426707, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape.  Overall image seems washed-out in places, maybe due to haze?  Consider less brightness, more saturation and contrast to compensate.</td>', 'Nice landscape.  Overall image seems washed-out in places, maybe due to haze?  Consider less brightness, more saturation and contrast to compensate.', '2006-11-18 10:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041764, 426564, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  Wish you had an angle with fewer distracting foreground trees.</td>', 'Nice colors.  Wish you had an angle with fewer distracting foreground trees.', '2006-11-18 10:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041765, 426785, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape.  The land seems lost in the mid-tone blahs, wish that it were brighter with more contrast.  This caused me to miss the wonderful capture of the sky at first glance, but a second viewing gives you a bump.</td>', 'Nice landscape.  The land seems lost in the mid-tone blahs, wish that it were brighter with more contrast.  This caused me to miss the wonderful capture of the sky at first glance, but a second viewing gives you a bump.', '2006-11-18 10:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041769, 426317, 44490, '<td valign="top">Wonderful wide-angle landscape.  Good composition, clarity, and demonstration of HDR.</td>', 'Wonderful wide-angle landscape.  Good composition, clarity, and demonstration of HDR.', '2006-11-18 10:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3042267, 426609, 16230, '<td valign="top">Very nice! It looks like a place I''d like to visit.</td>', 'Very nice! It looks like a place I''d like to visit.', '2006-11-18 17:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3042268, 426485, 16230, '<td valign="top">Hey, it''s the Boo! Cool shot! Looks more like a Malibu evening though. :D No matter, I''m giving it a 10.</td>', 'Hey, it''s the Boo! Cool shot! Looks more like a Malibu evening though. :D No matter, I''m giving it a 10.', '2006-11-18 17:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
