(3043312, 426623, 44490, '<td valign="top">Lovely combination of sky, foliage, water, and reflection.  Love it and hope it does well.</td>', 'Lovely combination of sky, foliage, water, and reflection.  Love it and hope it does well.', '2006-11-19 08:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3043315, 426824, 44490, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and clarity, nice combination of buildings, bridge, water, and reflections.</td>', 'Lovely colors and clarity, nice combination of buildings, bridge, water, and reflections.', '2006-11-19 08:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3043317, 426272, 44490, '<td valign="top">Picturesque scene, good perpective, composition, and show of HDR.  Love it.</td>', 'Picturesque scene, good perpective, composition, and show of HDR.  Love it.', '2006-11-19 08:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3043320, 426303, 35322, '<td valign="top">it seems the horizont is a bit tilted, otherwise is a great photo! add to fav</td>', 'it seems the horizont is a bit tilted, otherwise is a great photo! add to fav', '2006-11-19 08:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3043321, 426317, 35322, '<td valign="top">realy like a painting. very beautiful</td>', 'realy like a painting. very beautiful', '2006-11-19 08:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3043322, 426786, 35322, '<td valign="top">simply beautiful. good idea to take this on infrared</td>', 'simply beautiful. good idea to take this on infrared', '2006-11-19 08:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3043328, 426491, 44490, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene, colors, windmill, sky, boat, water, etc.  Might be better without the foreground screen of grases.  Are the specks in the sky birds?  Consider cloning out the wires.  Love it.</td>', 'Lovely scene, colors, windmill, sky, boat, water, etc.  Might be better without the foreground screen of grases.  Are the specks in the sky birds?  Consider cloning out the wires.  Love it.', '2006-11-19 08:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3043342, 426266, 44490, '<td valign="top">Striking demonstration of HDR, great DOF, lights shining on walkway, person.  Wonder what it looks like in full color.  Hope it does well.</td>', 'Striking demonstration of HDR, great DOF, lights shining on walkway, person.  Wonder what it looks like in full color.  Hope it does well.', '2006-11-19 08:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3043352, 426755, 44490, '<td valign="top">Interesting scene with grass covered hill, monument, road, and sparse trees, lovely colors, good composition.  You probably wished for better light on the monument.  I love it, and hope it does well.</td>', 'Interesting scene with grass covered hill, monument, road, and sparse trees, lovely colors, good composition.  You probably wished for better light on the monument.  I love it, and hope it does well.', '2006-11-19 08:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3043358, 426717, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice skyline with lights in the buildings.  Moving forward would be a better perspective IMHO, with less of the foreground soil and more of the highway -- clone out light pole in foreground.  Good demo of HDR.</td>', 'Nice skyline with lights in the buildings.  Moving forward would be a better perspective IMHO, with less of the foreground soil and more of the highway -- clone out light pole in foreground.  Good demo of HDR.', '2006-11-19 08:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3043368, 426734, 44490, '<td valign="top">Lovely reflection and colors.  Straight on perspective is imposing, I wonder if there is a more interesting angle?  With this perspective, consider perspective correction with advanced editing, squaring up the lines completely.</td>', 'Lovely reflection and colors.  Straight on perspective is imposing, I wonder if there is a more interesting angle?  With this perspective, consider perspective correction with advanced editing, squaring up the lines completely.', '2006-11-19 08:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3043459, 426315, 28532, '<td valign="top">The color is fantastic - nicely done!</td>', 'The color is fantastic - nicely done!', '2006-11-19 09:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3043463, 426546, 28532, '<td valign="top">Very cool!  You''ve taken an ordinary shot and made it really amazing - Nicely done!</td>', 'Very cool!  You''ve taken an ordinary shot and made it really amazing - Nicely done!', '2006-11-19 09:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3043721, 426485, 35545, '<td valign="top">Good use of HDR and a good subject, but the colors are pretty garish. Also some vignetting along the bottom.  If you put it there, fine, but IMNSHO it doesn''t add much.</td>', 'Good use of HDR and a good subject, but the colors are pretty garish. Also some vignetting along the bottom.  If you put it there, fine, but IMNSHO it doesn''t add much.', '2006-11-19 12:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3043742, 426212, 70, '<td valign="top">This is a nice image but I feel like the purpose of HDR here would have been to  bring out the darkness and shadows that are on the buildings and below. Also, the billboard is rather distracting...not sure if there''s a way to compose around that.</td>', 'This is a nice image but I feel like the purpose of HDR here would have been to  bring out the darkness and shadows that are on the buildings and below. Also, the billboard is rather distracting...not sure if there''s a way to compose around that.', '2006-11-19 13:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3043754, 426226, 70, '<td valign="top">Well shot and crisp focus but unfortunately the subject isn''t especially appealing...looks like these flowers have seen better days.</td>', 'Well shot and crisp focus but unfortunately the subject isn''t especially appealing...looks like these flowers have seen better days.', '2006-11-19 13:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3043755, 426503, 44490, '<td valign="top">The ceiling is probably the best feature here with the beautiful lines and lovely colors.  Most viewers wont like this ultra-wide perspective with the columns appearing to lean in.  Consider shooting in portrait mode with straight verticals, then crop - or else adjust the perspective in software, straightening out the verticals.  Good demonstration of HDR.  I like it.</td>', 'The ceiling is probably the best feature here with the beautiful lines and lovely colors.  Most viewers wont like this ultra-wide perspective with the columns appearing to lean in.  Consider shooting in portrait mode with straight verticals, then crop - or else adjust the perspective in software, straightening out the verticals.  Good demonstration of HDR.  I like it.', '2006-11-19 13:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3043756, 426766, 44490, '<td valign="top">Great flow of the waterfall, colors of the rocks, and reflection.  Very nice.</td>', 'Great flow of the waterfall, colors of the rocks, and reflection.  Very nice.', '2006-11-19 13:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3043757, 426781, 70, '<td valign="top">The way this shot has been processed makes it difficult to discern what the subject is. The fence in front is also rather distracting.</td>', 'The way this shot has been processed makes it difficult to discern what the subject is. The fence in front is also rather distracting.', '2006-11-19 13:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3043761, 426246, 70, '<td valign="top">Very cool! This is a nitpick but I almost wish the green and yellow cloth had been desaturated a bit so it wasn''t so bright...it makes it difficult to look at the rest of the image which is so beautiful. Nicely done otherwise.</td>', 'Very cool! This is a nitpick but I almost wish the green and yellow cloth had been desaturated a bit so it wasn''t so bright...it makes it difficult to look at the rest of the image which is so beautiful. Nicely done otherwise.', '2006-11-19 13:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3043764, 426802, 44490, '<td valign="top">Good demonstration of HDR, love the water and the rocks, colors.  I think that the ghostly person on the right would be better if he/she were more solid, or else eliminated.  Also consider less rock and more water in foreground.  Very nice.</td>', 'Good demonstration of HDR, love the water and the rocks, colors.  I think that the ghostly person on the right would be better if he/she were more solid, or else eliminated.  Also consider less rock and more water in foreground.  Very nice.', '2006-11-19 13:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3043765, 426346, 70, '<td valign="top">I think this image is nicely processed but I can''t help feeling like I''m looking at the dirty part when what I want to be looking at is the blue in the back. The mud puddle isn''t especially appealing.</td>', 'I think this image is nicely processed but I can''t help feeling like I''m looking at the dirty part when what I want to be looking at is the blue in the back. The mud puddle isn''t especially appealing.', '2006-11-19 13:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3043766, 426802, 22748, '<td valign="top">I love the texture of the rocks and water, it is so intriguing. The sky is gorgeous.</td>', 'I love the texture of the rocks and water, it is so intriguing. The sky is gorgeous.', '2006-11-19 13:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3043767, 426485, 44490, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors, demonstration of HDR, could be a poster for surfer gear. Wish for some/more fill on the face of the surfer, but I like it a lot as is.</td>', 'Lovely colors, demonstration of HDR, could be a poster for surfer gear. Wish for some/more fill on the face of the surfer, but I like it a lot as is.', '2006-11-19 13:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3043771, 426365, 70, '<td valign="top">Not sure the HDR helped this image any...it looks rather flat and overexposed now...and somewhat pixelated on the buildings.</td>', 'Not sure the HDR helped this image any...it looks rather flat and overexposed now...and somewhat pixelated on the buildings.', '2006-11-19 13:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3043774, 426609, 70, '<td valign="top">Very simple but very nice. I think I''d like about half of the foreground cropped out but I like the rest.</td>', 'Very simple but very nice. I think I''d like about half of the foreground cropped out but I like the rest.', '2006-11-19 13:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3043775, 426404, 44490, '<td valign="top">Lovely landscape, would prefer a perspective with more lake and less branches from the upper right and slightly less prominent foreground grasses.  Colors and clarity are great.</td>', 'Lovely landscape, would prefer a perspective with more lake and less branches from the upper right and slightly less prominent foreground grasses.  Colors and clarity are great.', '2006-11-19 13:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3043778, 426533, 51156, '<td valign="top">I like the curve of the road, suggests something about to happen</td>', 'I like the curve of the road, suggests something about to happen', '2006-11-19 13:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3043779, 426803, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice waterfall and demo of HDR with detail and color in the shadows, lines cascading down.  Very nice.</td>', 'Nice waterfall and demo of HDR with detail and color in the shadows, lines cascading down.  Very nice.', '2006-11-19 13:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3043782, 426742, 70, '<td valign="top">This has a rather strong purple cast that doesn''t seem quite natural.</td>', 'This has a rather strong purple cast that doesn''t seem quite natural.', '2006-11-19 13:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3043788, 426246, 44490, '<td valign="top">Good demonstration of HDR, consider perspective correction for verticals, or straight ahead angle with crop for straighter verticals.  I like the colors on the altar and the priest/person behind.</td>', 'Good demonstration of HDR, consider perspective correction for verticals, or straight ahead angle with crop for straighter verticals.  I like the colors on the altar and the priest/person behind.', '2006-11-19 13:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3043793, 426501, 44490, '<td valign="top">Love the tree and detail.  Overall image feels a little washed out, revisit tone mappings and levels for more contrast and richer blacks.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-11-23 08:23:57.</i></td>', 'Love the tree and detail.  Overall image feels a little washed out, revisit tone mappings and levels for more contrast and richer blacks.', '2006-11-19 13:35:01.000000', '2006-11-23 08:23:57.000000', 1),
(3043800, 426533, 44490, '<td valign="top">Love the road winding through the trees and the contrasting colors.  Simple and effective.</td>', 'Love the road winding through the trees and the contrasting colors.  Simple and effective.', '2006-11-19 13:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3043831, 426315, 4411, '<td valign="top">A great photo for the real heavy HDR treatment. It really works well.</td>', 'A great photo for the real heavy HDR treatment. It really works well.', '2006-11-19 13:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3043836, 426498, 4411, '<td valign="top">A standout entry and very good use of HDR processing.</td>', 'A standout entry and very good use of HDR processing.', '2006-11-19 13:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3043838, 426272, 4411, '<td valign="top">Maybe overdone on the processing, it''s borderline for sure, but an excellent photo nonetheless.</td>', 'Maybe overdone on the processing, it''s borderline for sure, but an excellent photo nonetheless.', '2006-11-19 13:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3043839, 426246, 4411, '<td valign="top">Textbook HDR. Works a treat.</td>', 'Textbook HDR. Works a treat.', '2006-11-19 13:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3043998, 426546, 22748, '<td valign="top">I like it. It''s definitely different, but very artistic. I''m afraid it may be voted down, but I like the creativity of it.</td>', 'I like it. It''s definitely different, but very artistic. I''m afraid it may be voted down, but I like the creativity of it.', '2006-11-19 16:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3044008, 426503, 22748, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous color!! Great detail and sharpness. A very crisp image. I love all the arches and lines and patterns, it is a very rhythmic composition. This is one of the best!!</td>', 'Gorgeous color!! Great detail and sharpness. A very crisp image. I love all the arches and lines and patterns, it is a very rhythmic composition. This is one of the best!!', '2006-11-19 16:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
