(3044487, 426340, 20075, '<td valign="top">I love the subtlety in your theme! :)  Took  me a moment to spot the other bench.  Nice DOF and contrast.  I think the HDR does help this one.</td>', 'I love the subtlety in your theme! :)  Took  me a moment to spot the other bench.  Nice DOF and contrast.  I think the HDR does help this one.', '2006-11-19 19:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
