(3045624, 426532, 7743, '<td valign="top">Even with the free version you can get results without the watermark.<br/> <br/>Just use the steps identified in the popup window when opening the program.<br/> <br/>From the HDR menu choose generate.  When that''s done, from the same menu, choose tone mapping.  Only if you save the generated HDR and then open it again for tone mapping will you get the watermark.<br/></td>', 'Even with the free version you can get results without the watermark. Just use the steps identified in the popup window when opening the program. From the HDR menu choose generate.  When that''s done, from the same menu, choose tone mapping.  Only if you save the generated HDR and then open it again for tone mapping will you get the watermark.', '2006-11-20 01:19:59.000000', NULL, 0),
