(3047569, 426498, 714, '<td valign="top">thanks guys.  Yes that was snow and it was also very windy and cold. brrrss..she is a little trooper.  <br/> <br/>I am a bit depressed that everyone thought it HAD to be three different photos.  Although I did try that.  In the end I just used one and messed with each shot individally and slapped them together. The challenge rules did not say I couldn''t do that.  Retarded voters.  "sigh"</td>', 'thanks guys.  Yes that was snow and it was also very windy and cold. brrrss..she is a little trooper.   I am a bit depressed that everyone thought it HAD to be three different photos.  Although I did try that.  In the end I just used one and messed with each shot individally and slapped them together. The challenge rules did not say I couldn''t do that.  Retarded voters.  "sigh"', '2006-11-20 12:30:38.000000', NULL, 0),
