(3048247, 426142, 66384, '<td valign="top">This helps me to understand HDR a little more. Nothing in the view is lost do to shadows and exposures. Good going for a speed challenge when you''re feeling lousy!</td>', 'This helps me to understand HDR a little more. Nothing in the view is lost do to shadows and exposures. Good going for a speed challenge when you''re feeling lousy!', '2006-11-20 16:18:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(3048362, 426705, 66384, '<td valign="top">This composite is really fun. I knew it wasn''t valid (the butterfly must have been feeding on Miracle Grow flowers.) :D) But challenge aside, the PS work was so well done. The bird really looks like it is observing the biggest darn butterfly he''s ever seen, and right on his nose!!  No good for challenges, but great for your portfolio.  Keep it up.</td>', 'This composite is really fun. I knew it wasn''t valid (the butterfly must have been feeding on Miracle Grow flowers.) :D) But challenge aside, the PS work was so well done. The bird really looks like it is observing the biggest darn butterfly he''s ever seen, and right on his nose!!  No good for challenges, but great for your portfolio.  Keep it up.', '2006-11-20 16:49:35.000000', NULL, 0),
