(3050979, 426246, 57378, '<td valign="top">I used to live in Canterbury and have some wonderful pictures inside the crypt before realizing that this is not allowed so I treasure those pics I managed to get. Makes me home sick. Great image.<br/>Jeff</td>', 'I used to live in Canterbury and have some wonderful pictures inside the crypt before realizing that this is not allowed so I treasure those pics I managed to get. Makes me home sick. Great image.Jeff', '2006-11-21 15:27:59.000000', NULL, 0),
