(3053566, 426303, 57315, '<td valign="top">Well done Mark!  I stand by my earlier comments. This should have ribbonned. Not that the entries above you were poor, just that they photographed already appealing subjects - the HDR is just a bit of gloss on top. Yours, as I said, is something far more interesting. I look forward to seeing your other HDR work!</td>', 'Well done Mark!  I stand by my earlier comments. This should have ribbonned. Not that the entries above you were poor, just that they photographed already appealing subjects - the HDR is just a bit of gloss on top. Yours, as I said, is something far more interesting. I look forward to seeing your other HDR work!', '2006-11-22 07:12:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(3053596, 426669, 37529, '<td valign="top">I too thought this excellent photo would finish much much higher.  I gave it a nine and thought it would finish in at least in the top ten.  Excellent clarity and range even though you couldn''t get the HDR to work.  Good job.</td>', 'I too thought this excellent photo would finish much much higher.  I gave it a nine and thought it would finish in at least in the top ten.  Excellent clarity and range even though you couldn''t get the HDR to work.  Good job.', '2006-11-22 07:25:21.000000', NULL, 0),
